        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Although interstate banking and branching may have resulted in increased competitive pressures in the markets in which the Company operates, interstate branching may also present competitive opportunities for locally-owned and managed banks, such as Union, that are familiar with the local markets and that emphasize personal service and prompt, local decision-making.",
        "start_character": 42614,
        "end_character": 42982
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000706863-26-000029",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000706863-26-000029-331b85f12efec75d",
        "accession_number": "0000706863-26-000029",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-20",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We compete for deposit accounts by offering customers competitive products and rates, personal service, local area expertise, convenient locations and access, and an array of financial services and products.",
        "start_character": 9730,
        "end_character": 9937
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000706863-26-000029",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000706863-26-000029-331b85f12efec75d",
        "accession_number": "0000706863-26-000029",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-20",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We compete for loan originations primarily through the interest rates and loan fees we charge, the types of loans we offer, and the efficiency and quality of services we provide.",
        "start_character": 10385,
        "end_character": 10563
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000706863-26-000029",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000706863-26-000029-331b85f12efec75d",
        "accession_number": "0000706863-26-000029",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-20",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Except as otherwise required or permitted by law, we are prohibited from disclosing nonpublic personal information except as provided in such policies and procedures.",
        "start_character": 37736,
        "end_character": 37902
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000706863-26-000029",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000706863-26-000029-331b85f12efec75d",
        "accession_number": "0000706863-26-000029",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Pursuant to the FACT Act, we have developed and implemented a written identity theft prevention program to detect, prevent, and mitigate identity theft in connection with the opening of certain accounts or certain existing accounts.",
        "start_character": 38816,
        "end_character": 39048
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000706863-26-000029",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000706863-26-000029-331b85f12efec75d",
        "accession_number": "0000706863-26-000029",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "The GLBA also requires that we develop, implement and maintain a comprehensive written information security program designed to ensure the security and confidentiality of customer information (as defined under the GLBA), to protect against anticipated threats or hazards to the security or integrity of such information;",
        "start_character": 37903,
        "end_character": 38223
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000706863-26-000029",
