        "filing_date": "2026-03-20",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are also required to send a notice to customers whose “sensitive information” has been compromised if unauthorized use of this information is “reasonably possible.” Most of the states, including the states where we operate, have enacted legislation concerning breaches of data security and our duties in response to a data breach.",
